The Dragon of the East Window — a Stained Glass film (Polargate · PolarMotion)

All images, characters, glass, lead, stone and light are drawn procedurally in code (no image assets).
Story, melody and characters are original.

Narration: synthetic voice.
Music: original score written in code with the repo sampler (core/audio/sampler.py).
Foley: synthesized in mix.py (glass modes, crack, lead creak, air, stone hall), no recordings.

